{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_03_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d16fd07c45f3250a779fa1c07845eb79a27c06491e4fb222e41e1312c0fcfb5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56a5aa7bcc8abe4d0352a353fcbef2af92fb20a1c290ba1e97fd2b3937d7bfba",
      "text": "那我们就开始讨论乐队大赛上演奏曲目的\n碰头会吧。有建议的人请提出来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12beaea15aa41eb436680303856e95e3988969b204b79a8cabb09e8ee642b7e9",
      "text": "我我有！流行歌曲就不错！\n如果是大家都知道的歌，气氛绝对超嗨的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:886cc3a1fba6043d461d240b2a642373831fd786b13deb9a4106494d54e06545",
      "text": "难道不会和其他参赛者撞车吗？\n太肤浅了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f49252275a3162e872faad14126839420db0bc0b0a61ca2d6e7e0e77eb2bf99",
      "text": "这么一说确实是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03aa4930692c39370689045c57bfacedb63582ec5ef94199e36238ef67dc154b",
      "text": "那不如干脆挑战难度极高的曲子\n怎么样？让其他人根本模仿不来的那种！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c49b90f56f96e2262b78858255733c0c930befc0596a23d14a00a1fb974b4ffb",
      "text": "你觉得以我们目前的水平，能演奏出别人\n都弹不来的高难度曲子吗？我觉得很悬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef6d01c364225921f2c4e87bb27fdc9d8ecbc0d59478a00f06e1728b50f03ea",
      "text": "啊，也是，你说得对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84b87d6cb2865695fc20d000df4c36f83df3e09ccb08b2900e9c8be977395869",
      "text": "既不和任何人撞车……\n现在的我们又能演奏的曲子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d844a81b935088cfadd019e041a047e63bae2c1a9e4110141afd46edc5f50d0",
      "text": "那、那个……\n我来写歌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:147ce9045b6cda8072a9d6ab298272f890256ec610f0ac8e81b1980634ff0adc",
      "text": "如果是原创曲目的话就只有我们能演奏，\n我觉得挺好的。……你们觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65a0dc07da985df6387c127f58cd44f8c7d43771c9e834987ffdf74a6565b929",
      "text": "真的假的！\n隼人，你忙得过来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ce94efd9e987a162fee56d4e049f2f176ff9bbd927208757df7ae730d51663",
      "text": "那就是说有新歌了对吧！？能够唱到隼人亲的\n新歌，真的太超级开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbde50ebc240a4e7b047aa117a6176ab5f834e418e2437d75bd6e17d71870847",
      "text": "确实我觉得那样最理想，\n不过距离大赛已经没有多少时间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d8bcd2d14e88483ee2a957a5f5729ad77a678f657328ca0a6faefabaed4a0ad",
      "text": "隼人，你没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d5e6ad94c0a9cbe22a0ce991d102505e9bf78518abac3c538ba0f0d0baa0540",
      "text": "包在我身上！\n我一定会写出一首超级帅气的曲子给你们看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be9662b8a38bbe0fdd7de1f6533e23aa632abffa8f5c2be090c1888de5b3aba9",
      "text": "……那，就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
